# Vercel auto-serves any root /public folder as static files, which was
# silently overriding the real app build (app/dist, via outputDirectory in
# vercel.json) at the domain root with this repo's old Render-era waitlist
# page instead. That folder is only used by the Node server (server.js) —
# irrelevant to the Vercel deploy, so it's excluded here entirely.
public/
